		(property "Function" "330R x4 series (edge rate / injection limit) for the J1201 even-row group behind D1206; element k sits between pins k and 9-k (UNI-ROYAL JLC-01-015 sec. 3.1): R706 EXP_INT1_N (PD10 EXTI10, J1201.16), R702 EXP_IO0 (PE1, J1201.26), R506 EXP_IO1 (PE0, J1201.28), R501 EXP_DETECT_N (PB4, J1201.32). J1201-side pins 8/7/6/5 face the D1206 NC pads 6/7/9/10 (flow-through); B.Cu north of D1206. Replaces R428/R429/R430/R432 (S-22)."
