		(property "Function" "ESD for J1201 pins 16/26/28/32 (EXP_INT1_N, EXP_IO0, EXP_IO1, EXP_DETECT_N). 4-ch 0.5 pF array, no VCC pin (no back-power path); pad-to-pad <=3 mm from J1201 on B.Cu, GND pins straight to the GND plane. NC pins tied to the facing IO channel for straight-through routing (SLVSBO7O Table 4-2 p.4, Fig. 4-3; P1-27): 10 = DETECT_N, 9 = IO1, 7 = IO0, 6 = INT1_N, feeding RN1201 1:1."
			(at 218.44 129.54 0)
