		(property "Function" "ESD for J1201 odd-row pins 5/7/9/13 (EXP_SPI_SCK, EXP_SPI_MOSI, EXP_SPI_MISO, EXP_SPI_CS0_N). 4-ch 0.5 pF array, no VCC pin (no back-power path); pad-to-pad <=3 mm from J1201 on B.Cu, GND pins straight to the GND plane. NC pins tied to the facing IO channel for straight-through routing (SLVSBO7O Table 4-2 p.4, Fig. 4-3; P1-27): 7 = MISO, 6 = CS0_N; 9/10 stay NC."
			(at 240.03 25.4 0)
