		(property "Function" "ESD for J1201 pins 33/35 (EXP_GATE, EXP_SYNC); channels D2+/D2- spare (NC). 4-ch 0.5 pF array, no VCC pin (no back-power path); pad-to-pad <=3 mm from J1201 on B.Cu, GND pins straight to the GND plane. NC pins tied to the facing IO channel for straight-through routing (SLVSBO7O Table 4-2 p.4, Fig. 4-3; P1-27): 9 = SYNC; 6/7/10 stay NC."
