		(property "Function" "RFVD-EXP v1.1 expansion mezzanine (40-pin Samtec LSHM 0.5 mm hermaphroditic, 5.0 mm stack) on B.Cu, mirrored, at about x 72, y 15.5-31.5 in the shield bay; 12 GND, +3V3_EXP 3/4/37/38, EXP_VHP 19-22 (symmetric under row swap and end reversal); pins 33-35 allocated in RFVD-EXP v1.1 (EXP_GATE, EXP_ANA_MON, EXP_SYNC), pin 36 reserved NC; -S superset footprint whose SH pads become GND vias with the -N part; LSHM-120-02.5-L-DV-A-S-K-TR (C3654193) is the alternate."
