		(property "Function" "ESD for J1201 pins 15/25/27/31 (EXP_SPI_CS1_N, EXP_I2C_SCL, EXP_I2C_SDA, EXP_RST_N). 4-ch 0.5 pF array, no VCC pin (no back-power path); pad-to-pad <=3 mm from J1201 on B.Cu, GND pins straight to the GND plane. NC pins tied to the facing IO channel for straight-through routing (SLVSBO7O Table 4-2 p.4, Fig. 4-3; P1-27): 10 = CS1_N, 6 = RST_N; 9/7 stay NC."
			(at 240.03 55.88 0)
